# Modern.js documentation

Read `node_modules/@modern-js/app-tools/docs/llms.txt` before changing Modern.js
configuration, APIs, routes, or conventions. These packaged docs match the
installed version and are the source of truth.

You can skip them for:

- Writing ordinary React components (not route components)
- Editing CSS or style files
- Adding utility functions or business logic
- Installing ordinary npm packages (unrelated to Modern.js)

